      "content": "i get that it's \"complex\" but that feels like a way to dodge the question. if you look at all the specific claims about fraudulent ballots and people tampering with the drop boxes, why is the official stance always \"it's fine\"? are those claims actually being investigated, or is the system just designed to ignore them so people don't lose faith?",
